983
01:05:52.540 --> 01:05:53.910
从先生 和夫人 普里查德的房间

984
01:06:00.120 --> 01:06:16.840
I&#x27;ll be doggone yeah that&#x27;s what hall said listen there&#x27;s just one thing I want to know

985
